      "biography": "<p>Crow-kin from an old Bench family on the mainland, raised to copy charts and never draw one. Has seen every coastline in his father&#39;s archive once, so he can draw them all, and can do his father&#39;s voice well enough to sign for him. He left with one satchel, three stolen pens, and a debt of disappointment he means to outrun.</p><p>Motivation: To escape the mundane and cruel life of the mainland, building power and knowledge to feel free from family and cultural expectations.</p><p>Path note: Walks the First Mate&#39;s path.</p>",
